          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "4aa02730-4b39-5ed3-b744-7203a11ae053",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 376,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:1",
          "start": 265
        },
        "quote": "(a) The ambulance service franchise application fee prescribed by TMC 5.10.040 has been paid to the City Clerk.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC AxB Art. XII § 5 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "968bbfe4-ab59-5284-b5a0-b663b8578416",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 759,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:2",
          "start": 377
        },
        "quote": "(b) On or before July 1, 2025 after passage of this franchise ordinance, the fees set forth in TMC 5.10.040(b) are due, including the business fee and an ambulance fee for each EMS ambulance in operation in the City of Topeka. An ambulance fee for each additional ambulance placed into operation after the initial fee payment is due at the time the additional ambulance is licensed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC AxB Art. XII § 5 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "5f1f42a7-03a4-5432-88b7-f4ec93b3015e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 924,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:3",
          "start": 760
        },
        "quote": "(c) On or before January 1st of each year within the term of this franchise ordinance, the fee set forth in TMC 5.10.040(c) for each ambulance to be renewed is due.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC AxB Art. XII § 5 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "6285b7db-e826-55f7-bc3b-f4464b3f44c8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1082,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:4",
          "start": 925
        },
        "quote": "(d) Within 30 days of the presentation of an invoice to EMS by the City, EMS shall make payments to the City Treasurer for the following types of assistance:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC AxB Art. XII § 5 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "71420058-7f48-5ef5-ba0b-e762dfd417e5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1538,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:5",
          "start": 1083
        },
        "quote": "(1) For each Topeka Fire Department response to EMS’s request for a nonemergency assist of any patient, EMS shall pay a fee of $250.00 per transport. For purposes of this subsection, “nonemergency” means any request that was not initiated by a 911 call. Any time that such fee is incurred, Topeka Fire Department shall make written request for payment that includes the date, address, and Topeka Fire Department incident number. (Ord. 20561 § 5, 5-20-25.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xii-5:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
